{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56680","headline":"灵叟吟 · 无名氏","name":"灵叟吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我欲学菩提，输他释迦先。\n我欲学阐提，落他调达後。\n不涉二家风，未免中途走。\n设使总不是，凭何而开口。\n开口不开口，切忌犯灵叟。\n着会个中意，望南观北斗。\n（见延寿《宗镜录》卷四十一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}